# Ad-hoc env dumps. env-upload.txt was created to paste variables into a
# hosting dashboard and carried a real Firebase private key, Mongo URI,
# OpenAI key and Mapbox secret token — it reached a commit before being
# caught. Matched by pattern, not by name, because the next one will be
# called something slightly different.
env-upload.txt
*env-upload*
*.env.txt
env-*.txt
